  <name>W06 Thu – Threshold 5×1km</name>
  <description>58min. 12min easy warmup → 5×1km @ Z4 (5:40-6:00/km) with 90sec easy jog recovery → 16min easy cooldown. Faster than race pace to make race pace feel easier. Peak quality run of the plan.</description>
